[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヘルト！\u3000料理が終わるまで、そこで待っててね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held! Stay right there until the cooking's done!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃ、みんな！\u3000始めるわよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alright, everyone! Let's get started!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "食材の準備は！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are the ingredients ready?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "できてるよー。\n商人もやってる僕が選んだんだ。どれもいい食材だよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "All set. I picked them out myself—merchant's eye for quality, you know. Good stuff, all of it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "肉いっぱいじゃあ！\u3000肉は見ているだけで元気になる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So much meat! Just looking at it fills Zero with energy!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゼロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zero"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうね、お肉は偉大だわ。で、調理道具は！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Meat truly is magnificent. Now, what about the cooking tools?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "は、はい！\nヤド姉と一緒に、良さそうなやつ持ってきたよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Y-yes! Jadwiga and I went and found some good ones!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "食器はどや！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And the dishes?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "粋で洒落たやつ、揃えてきたよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Stylish and chic, every last one!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レシピ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The recipe!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ゴゥ兄様と共に仕上げました。\n再現率は９割２分といったところでしょうか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou and I finalized it together. I estimate we have reproduced approximately ninety-two percent of the original."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liebe"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よし！\u3000それじゃあ調理開始よ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alright! Then let's start cooking!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
