  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "キューン、鍋は重いだろう。\nお兄ちゃんに任せろ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn, that pot's heavy. Let your brother handle it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "火、危険。\n私がやる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fire. Dangerous. I will manage it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もう、ゴゥ兄もヤド姉も過保護だなぁ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You two are so overprotective, honestly..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "肉の番は我に任せろ！\n……うまそうじゃなあ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Leave the meat to Zero! ...It smells incredible already."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゼロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zero"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "生だから、つまみ食いしちゃダメだよ……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's raw, so no sneaking bites, okay...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "食材は、火の通りやすさを考えて切るんだ。\nだからこれは、あっちの食材より小さく……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You want to cut them small enough for the heat to get through evenly. So this one should be a bit smaller than that one..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うーん、こうかしら？\nあれ、小さくしすぎたかも？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm, like this? Oh wait—did I go too small?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ははは！\n歪だが、味があっていいじゃないか！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ha! A little lopsided, but it's got character!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ってこらシトリン！\u3000\n手が空いてるなら食材切るのを手伝っておくれ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, Citrine! If your hands are free, get over here and help with the chopping!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え～？\u3000ヴァレリアがダメダメな分、\n僕の力が必要なのかな？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm~ I wonder if my superior skills are needed to make up for a certain someone's shortcomings?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "くっ……事実だけど\n言い方がいちいちムカつくわね……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh... you're not wrong, but do you have to say it like that..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今です、キューン！\nそこの調味料を入れてください",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now, Quinn! Add the seasoning—right there."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liebe"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん！\u3000レシピ分量ぴったり、入れたよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Got it! Exactly the right amount, just like the recipe says!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "キューン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よろしい。次の工程は……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Good. The next step is..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liebe"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "１分煮込んだ後、次の食材を投入",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Simmer for one minute. Then add the next ingredient."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その通りです。この工程を乱すわけにはいきません",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Correct. We must not disturb this process."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liebe"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "妹たちよ、兄に何か手伝えることはあるか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sisters, is there anything your brother can help with?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ではそこで１分数えていてください",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes—stand there and count to sixty."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liebe"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いきなり決めていきなり始めたけれど、\nなんかいい感じね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We jumped right in without much planning, and yet... this feels right, doesn't it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（みんなで作る思い出の味……\n\u3000これならきっと、今のヘルトにも……）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(A dish full of memories, made together... surely even Held, the way he is now...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]